WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,300
Do you know that when others are doing things?

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,260
It's easy to make phone calls

3
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:18,670
Death seems to have been faked and violently

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:20,850
They hung him up and beat him for three days

5
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:25,460
It seems I haven’t settled the score with you yet, right?

6
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:28,300
I'll ask my boss to talk to you now

7
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,060
Isn’t this my brother Hao?

8
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,540
I didn't see the caller ID just now

9
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:40,850
What do you need, little brother?

10
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:42,090
Post a task for me

11
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:44,690
Find as many unions as possible to come to Lombok City for support

12
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:45,970
Please help me write electronic books

13
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:47,490
Wait until I make money someday to pay you back

14
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:48,800
what do you want to do
